      "publishedAt": "2026-09-22T15:54:16.000Z",
      "snippet": " <p><strong>Release:</strong> <a href=\"https://github.com/simonw/llm-typesafe/releases/tag/0.1a0\">llm-typesafe 0.1a0</a></p> <p>I built this new plugin for <a href=\"https://llm.datasette.io/\">LLM</a> to add support for <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/2026/Sep/21/jev/\">TypeSafe AI's new Jev model</a>. Install it like this:</p> <pre><code>llm install llm-typesafe </code></pre> <p>Then set an API key (<a href=\"https://console.typesafe.ai/\">get one here</a>, the waitlist seems to move pretty fast",
